, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [14, 0.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "bf2f0aeb60414b9990fa", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 5570.25, "width": 390, "height": 581.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 211417810, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 555248245, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1763729000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "37920688134f49769909", "type": "text", "x": 14, "y": 5610.25, "width": 316.96, "height": 525.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 419717291, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1391589993, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1763729000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "• BUILD PRIORITY: secure document upload\n(private storage + admin-only access) is\nOPTIONAL (P1). If not built, hide the\nupload box and keep the line 'You can still\napply without documents; CrowdAid may\nrequest them privately later.'\n• STATES (inline): field error shown on\nphone (3px border + ⚠ text); on submit an\nerror summary banner appears at the top.\nOptional fields never error.\n• Upload progress per file (shown: 1 done,\n1 at 62%); failed file = Retry / Remove,\nnever blocks submit.\n• Submit → button 'Submitting…' (disabled).\nFailure → banner 'We couldn't send your\napplication', answers + files kept, 'Try\nagain'.\n• SUCCESS panel replaces the form:\n'Application received', reference CA-\nREQ-0001, status 'Received · awaiting\nreview', 'This is not an approval. No\npublic campaign has been created.', next\nsteps (review → more info only if needed →\nseparate consent before publishing), 'Back\nto home'.\n• 'Myself': relationship hidden, patient\nname pre-filled from applicant name.\n• Build: P0 = 1 form + private review data;\nstructured application, consents and\nseparate publication consent unchanged.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• BUILD PRIORITY: secure document upload\n(private storage + admin-only access) is\nOPTIONAL (P1). If not built, hide the\nupload box and keep the line 'You can still\napply without documents; CrowdAid may\nrequest them privately later.'\n• STATES (inline): field error shown on\nphone (3px border + ⚠ text); on submit an\nerror summary banner appears at the top.\nOptional fields never error.\n• Upload progress per file (shown: 1 done,\n1 at 62%); failed file = Retry / Remove,\nnever blocks submit.\n• Submit → button 'Submitting…' (disabled).\nFailure → banner 'We couldn't send your\napplication', answers + files kept, 'Try\nagain'.\n• SUCCESS panel replaces the form:\n'Application received', reference CA-\nREQ-0001, status 'Received · awaiting\nreview', 'This is not an approval. No\npublic campaign has been created.', next\nsteps (review → more info only if needed →\nseparate consent before publishing), 'Back\nto home'.\n• 'Myself': relationship hidden, patient\nname pre-filled from applicant name.\n• Build: P0 = 1 form + private review data;\nstructured application, consents and\nseparate publication consent unchanged.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "f628a8369a274f10b286", "type": "text", "x": 14, "y": 5582.25, "width": 114.66, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 806759598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 23150374, "isDeleted": false,