same page;\nthe card button scrolls to it and pre-\nselects the outreach.\n• SUCCESS panel replaces the form: 'You're\nregistered! CrowdAid will send your\nbriefing on WhatsApp before the outreach.'\n+ outreach details + 'Back to home'.\n• EMPTY: no outreach → card area says 'No\nupcoming outreaches right now' with links\nto Campaigns and Practical help; form\nhidden.\n• Validation / submitting / failure use the\nshared components. Minimum age = open\ndecision (not shown).\n• Build: GET outreaches (seeded) + POST\nregistration.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• Registration form sits on the same page;\nthe card button scrolls to it and pre-\nselects the outreach.\n• SUCCESS panel replaces the form: 'You're\nregistered! CrowdAid will send your\nbriefing on WhatsApp before the outreach.'\n+ outreach details + 'Back to home'.\n• EMPTY: no outreach → card area says 'No\nupcoming outreaches right now' with links\nto Campaigns and Practical help; form\nhidden.\n• Validation / submitting / failure use the\nshared components. Minimum age = open\ndecision (not shown).\n• Build: GET outreaches (seeded) + POST\nregistration.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "f965e273641c4fffa3f9", "type": "text", "x": 734, "y": 4282.25, "width": 114.66, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1434285568, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 895443260, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1763729000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "NOTES & STATES", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "NOTES & STATES", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "fa190c999a214310952f", "type": "text", "x": 144