e unlocks only when verification = Verified. Publish unlocks only when status = Approved and both consent/review boxes are ticked; confirm\nmodal before going live.\n• Simplest build: 3 tabs, 1 list + 1 detail panel, status is a single field; messages to applicants are sent outside the app.\n• Campaign updates (Section 6 of page 3) are seeded for the demo; 'Add update' = P1.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• UPDATED v0.4.1: third tab 'Volunteer registrations' (read-only list: volunteer, contact, outreach, role, availability).\n• Practical help offers tab only records status (New / Contacted / Not needed); no matching or assignment to patients.\n• PROTECTED: /admin shows a sign-in form (email + password, pre-created accounts) until signed in. Not linked from public pages. Sign-in is a state\nof this page, not a separate page.\n• Stages: Received → In review (opened) → Verified (verification set) → Approved (decision) → Published (publish section). Also More info requested /\nRejected.\n• MODAL (reason required): Request more info (what's needed + message) · Approve (note) · Reject (reason + message). One shared modal component,\nlogged with admin name + time.\n• Approve unlocks only when verification = Verified. Publish unlocks only when status = Approved and both consent/review boxes are ticked; confirm\nmodal before going live.\n• Simplest build: 3 tabs, 1 list + 1 detail panel, status is a single field; messages to applicants are sent outside the app.\n• Campaign updates (Section 6 of page 3) are seeded for the demo; 'Add update' = P1.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "8d16ae21a4b04cb5b1e5", "type": "text", "x": 1454, "y": 4575.75, "width": 114.66, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, 